Z||000014||88QuadPagasus||12-20-2001||05:35 AM||||Thanks for the replies!!<BR>my bad it's a Tech 4, not quad 4(Fiero information overload)<BR>From all the replies I guess I'm going to go with a little bit of each better air filter, better tires and wheels, and already getting a cd deck.  (by the way it's an auto, I wanted a manual, but the t-top, 88year, and low milage sold me)<P>------------------<BR>88 Quad 4<BR>98 CamaroSS Convt(for sale)<BR>70 CamaroRS (under resto)||||reg||14
Z||000015||artherd||12-20-2001||06:37 AM||||Toss this in!:<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/northstar/2/nstar-front-on.jpg">  <P>Ok, that should probally be the LAST mod you do (after suspension, brakes, bearings, running gear, etc.)<P>Get everything Rodney Dickman makes, his short shifters in particuliar are TOP NOTCH! <A HREF="http://www.rodneydickman.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.rodneydickman.com</A> <P>Leather seats are great! <A HREF="http://www.mrmikes.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.mrmikes.com/</A> <P>Lastly, a set of 17" wheels and GOOD tyres really makes these cars sing! <P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P>------------------<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/sig1.jpeg">     <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top, Metalic Red                     "Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>88 Formula, Northstar, Silver                                        -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"<p>[This message has been edited by artherd (edited 12-20-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000016||LZeitgeist||12-20-2001||06:57 AM||||O.K., this is the first time I've ever suggested this...<P>DON'T SHORTEN THE SHIFTER!!<P>(being that it's an automatic, anyway... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">)||||reg||1
